{
    "word": "installer",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "44420972-2831-35a6-834d-395ca8f5f568",
                "word": "installer",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4d3dc703-6c78-4d7e-a416-f47963d36136",
                        "entry_id": "44420972-2831-35a6-834d-395ca8f5f568",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "installers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2aa16a1f-25ff-34e4-8d91-8c78a7b188e0",
                        "entry_id": "44420972-2831-35a6-834d-395ca8f5f568",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who installs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8caf14d5-085d-4d83-8d2d-bb72d146e1d1",
                                "sense_id": "2aa16a1f-25ff-34e4-8d91-8c78a7b188e0",
                                "text": "In the event industry there are two critical times when safety is often compromised, at bump-in and at bump-out. At bump-in the organizer is usually pressed for time and it is not uncommon for installers to work around the clock. At the end of the show or exhibition, bump-out carries an even higher risk as everyone is exhausted."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bee75300-c0ae-320b-9f39-03a99d1d0b48",
                        "entry_id": "44420972-2831-35a6-834d-395ca8f5f568",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A program that installs software in a computer and prepares it for use."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad802074-24c7-4c00-aa4c-d02e167b48c8",
                                "sense_id": "bee75300-c0ae-320b-9f39-03a99d1d0b48",
                                "text": "Because this version of the Windows Installer is aware of the GAC, it has the capability to publish components into it. […] You can manually or programmatically push an assembly into the GAC by using the command-line tool Gacutil.exe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e7720f0-e6a5-4ec1-ae6b-627ef530b0d3",
                                "sense_id": "bee75300-c0ae-320b-9f39-03a99d1d0b48",
                                "text": "Slackware does not include a graphical installer. Its package manager does not perform any dependency resolution. This can be jarring for new users, particularly within the last few years, but it also enables a deeper understanding of the system."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d28b5bbc-b94a-4e7a-9803-f9c0bf8eb1c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "44420972-2831-35a6-834d-395ca8f5f568",
                        "source_sense_description": "person who installs",
                        "target_lang_word": "installateur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "installateur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a2522c1-199b-3c04-8abb-7a24b9a0ce04",
                                        "entry_id": "a0d6790c-77cf-3a63-a5e6-59bb2acf2ab0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui s’occupe d’installation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13a4a119-5379-4a45-8f0b-ece4daca10dc",
                                                "sense_id": "1a2522c1-199b-3c04-8abb-7a24b9a0ce04",
                                                "text": "Le maire de Montreuil institue un « moratoire sur le déploiement des compteurs Linky ». La ville veut suspendre l’installation de ces compteurs controversés par un sous-traitant d’Enedis. Des tensions et des incidents sont survenus entre les installateurs et les habitants ces dernières semaines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "installateur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24fea741-ce89-39ef-9444-07567e16f093",
                                        "entry_id": "eceb630d-fc46-3cb7-b97f-6e1c12665c60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Programme d’installation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af95e7a3-80a5-4a28-90e8-a5a030310e71",
                                                "sense_id": "24fea741-ce89-39ef-9444-07567e16f093",
                                                "text": "L’installateur peut être utilisé pour résoudre des problèmes avec le système, par exemple s’il refuse de démarrer. Les premières étapes sont identiques à une installation classique mais l’installateur ne proposera pas de lancer l’outil de partitionnement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
